                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Since the POE is used to power something, are there any features we miss if it isn't done?  Is there any dependency we should add here?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-ventura2/plat-svc/files/marvell-switch-poe-init.service",
                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the reminder. \nPoE power may need to be enabled after the switch network is initialized, so downstream devices can access the network immediately.\n\nAs the handshake is done over a USB-serial interface, adding response checks and retries improves robustness."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-ventura2/plat-svc/files/marvell-switch-poe-init.sh",
